/-!
# Round six, item language (I3): the bridge from the compact row interface `RowUCP′`

`IL2C.RowUCP'` (the I2′ compact row additions) is literally `RowUCCP`, so `p14UH'_of` applies
to every Lemma 12 table with a canonical code.
